pisode":null}]},"mv751052":{"show_id":"mv751052","tmdb_id":751052,"content_type":"movie","title":"عروسة وجوز عرسان","title_en":"Bride and two grooms","title_fr":null,"original_title":null,"tagline":null,"description":"تعمل (ثريا) في فرقة (عصفور) المسرحية، وتتزوج من المخرج (عصام) رغم حب الممثل (شاكر) لها، يسافر (عصام) إلى الخارج وتغرق الباخرة التي يستقلها، تمر السنوات القانونية لغياب الزوج، فتتزوج (ثريا) من (شاكر)، يعود (عصام) فجأة ويصدم الجميع بهذه العودة، وهو يعرف أن زوجته تزوجت أثناء غيابه من صديقه، تقع (ثريا) في حيرة وتتوالى الأحداث.","description_en":"Soria works in the theatrical troupe \"Asfour Troupe\" and marries the director, Essam, despite the actor Shaker being in love with her. Essam travels abroad, and the ship he's on sinks. After the legal waiting period for a missing spouse passes, Soria marries Shaker. Essam suddenly returns, shocking everyone with his reappearance. He is unaware that his wife married his friend during his absence. Soria is torn – Essam insists on reclaiming her, while she feels affection for both husbands. Sensing Soria's inner conflict, Shaker divorces her and marries his colleague Sanaa. Meanwhile, Essam returns to Soria once again.","description_fr":"","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sdUhNi4kLlnK7vkr8wsy40NoLZL.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qdlGMNU47u56v0OKxpnCjWRz8PA.jpg","has_poster":true,"rating":null,"vote_count":null,"age_rating":null,"year":"1982","release_date":"1982-05-17","runtime_minutes":null,"status":"Released","country":"مصر","language":"العربية","genres":["كوميديا","دراما","عائلي"],"genre_keys":["comedy","drama","family"],"similar":["mv415813","mv137204","mv106646","mv194","mv493623","mv603661","mv116745","mv10830"],"director":"يحيى العلمي","cast":[{"name":"سمير غانم","character":null,"profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/vSqmd98zrxOAnDFnBGnt4Wihn7B.jpg"},{"name":"يونس شلبي","character":null,"profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/jLtc7MnYVPHGdIyIhKeVESVdpb7.jpg"},{"